  characterName: Elian
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bb6ee8b3f09e6646914fa09e882258f, type: 3}
  age: 0
  gender: 0
  birthdate: 
  appearance: He has long, curly, and somewhat messy light brown hair with traces
    of dry earth. He always goes barefoot or wears rope sandals. He wears simple
    tunics handmade from natural fibers, adorned with flowers, seeds, or small feathers
    he finds on his walks.
  personalityTraits: 0e0000001200000003000000
  motivations: He wants to earn an honest living while protecting his family's land
    and showing that living a simple and happy life is compatible.
  background: 'Elian was born into a family of merchants who valued prestige, possessions,
    and appearances. At 14, during a trading trip, he got lost in a forest and spent
    days eating fruits and observing animals. That experience changed his life. He
    renounced his inheritance and went to live in harmony with nature.



    Over
    the years, he earned the nickname "Roots" for his connection to the earth. He
    communicates with animals as if they were old friends and has a special talent
    for making even the most withered plant flourish. Many see him as an eccentric,
    but those who get close to him discover a simple and profound wisdom.'
  speechStyle: 0
  otherInfo: 
